<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 6.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 6.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Radio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>-The list of banks with correspondt accounts frozen in St Petersburg by the St Petersburg tax police includes several banks that no longer exist in Estonia.</p>
<p>- Erki Nool was in 12th place after seven events in the World Athletics Championship in Athens.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
